<title>SOUTH AFRICA: HJ Joel declares five cent dividend.</title>
<headline>HJ Joel declares five cent dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Type of share: ordinary</p>
<p>Amount: 5 cts</p>
<p>Pay date: August 1</p>
<p>Record date: July 11</p>
<p>Full name: H.J. Joel Gold Mining Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm said that the dividend had been declared in respect of all 360-million ordinary shares issued, absorbing 18.03 million rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
